<title>USA: Tesoro to pay $20 mln for Zapata stakes.</title>
<headline>Tesoro to pay $20 mln for Zapata stakes.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tesoro Petroleum Corp said Monday that its Bolivian subsidiary, Tesoro Bolivia, purchased the interests of Zapata Exploration that it didn't already own for $20 million.</p>
<p>Zapata Exploration is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Zapata Corp. Under the terms of the agreement Tesoro will acquire 100 percent of the two blocks held jointly by it and Zapata.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase price for blocks 18 and 20 includes working capital and the assumption of certain liabilities.</p>
</text>
